  "notes": "backlog worker A 2026-11-11: the fix for rainbow_wool (whose 30 s successor this stunt already was), cut short per the lead: seven sheep dyed red to purple, the rainbow, then a jeb_ name tag turns the last white one into every colour (its cycle x3 in the last second, a ding on it): 11.1 s (stunt floor 8 s). Plateau field. 2 review rounds (fresh-session reviewer), READY. Nitpicks: the rainbow shot at 8.4-9.3 s is small and far, the white sheep behind the hand; a grass tint gradient early on (biome border); the jeb_ nameplate drops when the crosshair leaves the sheep (vanilla). The all-jeb_ and shearing beats are recorded but unused",
